      "id": "python@2026.09.14",
      "variant": "python",
      "release": "2026.09.14",
      "title": {
        "ja": "Python 開発",
        "en": "Python"
      },
      "summary": {
        "ja": "Python アプリ、スクリプト、データ処理向け",
        "en": "Python applications, scripts and data work"
      },
      "description": {
        "ja": "Base に Python 3 の開発環境 (venv、pip、uv、Poetry、pytest、Ruff、mypy、Black) を加えた構成です。python3・pip とツールは /opt/pytools の専用 venv (claude ユーザー所有) から PATH に載るので、pip install は sudo なしでそこに入り、OS の Python は汚しません。",
        "en": "Base plus a Python 3 development setup: venv, pip, uv, Poetry, pytest, Ruff, mypy and Black. python3, pip and the tools on PATH come from a dedicated venv under /opt/pytools that the claude user owns, so pip install works without sudo, lands there, and leaves the OS Python alone."
      },
